bot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":175351029,"discussion_id":"99596c82179af63fdff37b724de24a170cad4038","body":"这里的注释 reset preCoreNum_ 只是复述了下一行代码，没有讲清楚为什么要重置，而且本文件其他注释都是中文，这里突然用英文显得不一致。结合本次提交的意图，真正的原因是尾块与整块用的是不同的 tiling，如果继续沿用整块在第 309 行 GetPreCoreNum 累计得到的 preCoreNum_，会在尾块的核偏移计算里造成 uint64_t 溢出。建议把注释改成说明原因的中文，例如：尾块使用独立 tiling，需将 preCoreNum_ 归零，避免沿用整块累计值导致核偏移计算溢出。这样后来人一眼就能明白这行不是可有可无的。","created_at":"2026-06-11T23:17:01+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-12T17:59:27+08:00","user":{"id":"6822c87d24adff5452d7ba18","login":"Allan_Yu","object_id":"6822c87d24adff5452d7ba18","name":"YuZhengzhong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Allan_Yu"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"680a0031c6be6f6a0f719f68","login":"captainmiaow","object_id":"680a0031c6be6f6a0f719f68","name":"captainmiaow","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/captainmiaow"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":358,"end_new_line":358,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":175362203,"body":">这里的注释 reset preCoreNum_ 只是复述了下一行代码，没有讲清楚为什么要重置，而且本文件其他注释都是中文，这里突然用英文显得不一致。结合本次提交的意图，真正的原因是尾块与整块用的是不同的 tiling，如果继续沿用整块在第 309 行 GetPreCoreNum 累计得到的 preCoreNum_，会在尾块的核偏移计算里造成 uint64_t 溢出。建议把注释改成说明原因的中文，例如：尾块使用独立 tiling，需将 preCoreNum_ 归零，避免沿用整块累计值导致核偏移计算溢出。这样后来人一眼就能明白这行不是可有可无的。\n\n[@Allan_Yu](https://gitcode.com/Allan_Yu) \n\n好的，改一下","created_at":"2026-06-12T09:30:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-12T17:59:27+08:00","user":{"id":"680a0031c6be6f6a0f719f68","login":"captainmiaow","object_id":"680a0031c6be6f6a0f719f68","name":"captainmiaow","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/captainmiaow"}},{"id":175365725,"body":"changed this line on [df0e2cfe](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/commits/detail/df0e2cfe51782f97ee016f5a0df4f8b3755fa956?ref=9.1.0-beta.2&prId=6788) view [diff detail](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/6788/diffs?diffId=6436603&start_sha=1f4a4c3d8e41a9511e86a5ad7c24395c29a46c29&filePath=mc2/all_gather_matmul_v2/op_kernel/arch35/all_gather_quant_bmm.h#4e109cc2389532e5951eda090ca5b23701c6939b_358_358)","created_at":"2026-06-12T09:47:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-12T09:47:29+08:00","user":{"id":"680a0031c6be6f6a0f719f68","login":"captainmiaow","object_id":"680a0031c6be6f6a0f719f68","name":"captainmiaow","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/captainmiaow"}}]},{"id":175351034,"discussion_id":"e781c223a71ec7e94b3f2826323f6e57d44a914e","body":"这次修复是对的，整块在第 309 行把 preCoreNum_ 累计起来，尾块计算前归零，和整块起始时同样从 0 开始保持了对称。不过 preCoreNum_ 作为跨块调用的累计状态，目前是靠调用方记得在合适的位置手动重置来保证正确，这种方式比较脆弱：以后若在整块和尾块之外再增加一类分块计算，很容易忘记重置而重新引入同样的溢出。可以考虑在每组分块计算开始时统一归零，或让 MatmulKernelComputeGather 内部负责管理该状态，从根上避免依赖调用方的累计溢出。","created_at":"2026-06-11T23:17:04+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-12T17:59:26+08:00","user":{"id":"6822c87d24adff5452d7ba18","login":"Allan_Yu","object_id":"6822c87d24adff5452d7ba18","name":"YuZhengzhong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Allan_Yu"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"680a0031c6be6f6a0f719f68","login":"captainmiaow","object_id":"680a0031c6be6f6a0f719f68","name":"captainmiaow","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/captainmiaow"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":359,"end_new_line":359,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":175365723,"body":"changed this line on [df0e2cfe](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/commits/detail/df0e2cfe51782f97ee016f5a0df4f8b3755fa956?ref=9.1.0-beta.2&prId=6788) view [diff detail](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/6788/diffs?diffId=6436603&start_sha=1f4a4c3d8e41a9511e86a5ad7c24395c29a46c29&filePath=mc2/all_gather_matmul_v2/op_kernel/arch35/all_gather_quant_bmm.h#4e109cc2389532e5951eda090ca5b23701c6939b_358_359)","created_at":"2026-06-12T09:47:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-12T09:47:29+08:00","user":{"id":"680a0031c6be6f6a0f719f68","login":"captainmia